  "versionNotes": [
    {
      "edition": ".NET 9, .NET 10, and .NET 11 LINQ additions",
      "items": [
        ".NET 9 added `CountBy`, `AggregateBy`, and ordering helpers including `Order` and `OrderDescending` to LINQ. .NET 10 added the platform `System.Linq.AsyncEnumerable` class; use its package when targeting earlier frameworks, and check package versions for APIs backported to .NET 10. .NET 11 added `FullJoin` and tuple-returning Join/GroupJoin overloads to Enumerable and Queryable; the async FullJoin API is in .NET 11 and is also package-provided for .NET 10. These are library APIs, not C# language syntax; package and target-framework availability must be checked when multitargeting."
      ],
      "sourceUrls": [
